# Bacillus anthracis MLVA-15 of Van Ert et al. 2007, in the order of the published primer
# table, which is by multiplex reaction: 7-1 (BaVNTR12, 19, 35), 7-2 (BaVNTR16, 23), 7-3
# (BaVNTR17, 32), 8-1 (vrrA, vrrB1, CG3), 8-2 (pXO1-aat, pXO2-at, vrrB2), 8-3 (vrrC1) and
# 8-4 (vrrC2). The eight MLVA-8 loci therefore do not appear in the Keim order used by
# bacillus_mlva8_keim_2000, so the two profile strings are not aligned with each other.
# Fluorescent label prefixes in the source primer table are not part of the oligonucleotides
# and are not included here; scheme.yml records which primer carries which dye. Every reverse
# primer of the seven BaVNTR loci carries a 5' G that is not in the genome, which is kept
# because it is part of the published oligonucleotide; see markers.tsv. The expected size is a
# search window around the reference product, not the product itself; it only bounds the
# search and does not affect allele calls.
BaVNTR12	CGTACGAAGTAGAAGTCATTAA	GCATATAATTGCACCTCATCTAG	80-220
BaVNTR19	GTGATGAAATCGGACAAGTTAGGAG	GAAATATTTTATTAAACATGCTTTCCATCC	70-220
BaVNTR35	AAATAATATGTTCCTTTTGCTG	GTCCTGAAATAAATGCTGAAT	80-240
BaVNTR16	CTCTTGAAAATATAAAACGCA	GAATAATAAGGGTTCTCATGGTAT	200-420
BaVNTR23	TTTAGAAACGTTATCACGCTTA	GTAATACGTATGGTTCATTCCC	140-340
BaVNTR17	TAGGTAAACAAATTTTCGTAATC	GATCGTACAACAGCAATTATCAT	300-540
BaVNTR32	AACTGGATCCAGGAGATTATA	GAAACAAGAGCAAACCCAAT	440-760
vrrA	CACAACTACCACCGATGGCACA	GCGCGTTTCGTTTGATTCATAC	250-450
vrrB1	ATAGGTGGTTTTCCGCAAGTTATTC	GATGAGTTTGATAAAGAATAGCCTGTG	180-350
CG3	TGTCGTTTTACTTCTCTCTCCAATAC	AGTCATTGTTCTGTATAAAGGGCAT	110-250
pXO1-aat	CAATTTATTAACGATCAGATTAAGTTCA	TCTAGAATTAGTTGCTTCATAATGGC	90-220
pXO2-at	TCATCCTCTTTTAAGTCTTGGGT	GTGTGATGAACTCCGACGACA	100-220
vrrB2	CACAGGCTATTCTTTATCAAACTCATC	CCCAAGGTGAAGATTGTTGTTGA	100-280
vrrC1	GAAGCAAGAAAGTGATGTAGTGGAC	CATTTCCTCAAGTGCTACAGGTTC	450-800
vrrC2	CCAGAAGAAGTGGAACCTGTAGCAC	GTCTTTCCATTAATCGCGCTCTATC	450-700
